    "detailed_description": "<h1>Kickstarter Launches This Month!</h1><p>Consider Supporting Us: <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/73c20c90b091834dc1dc9490998af83a.avif?t=1726673671\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>FIGHT against legendary beings!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/7657eaab2696e08441ebf3fab3109fc6.poster.avif?t=1726673671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/7657eaab2696e08441ebf3fab3109fc6.webm?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/7657eaab2696e08441ebf3fab3109fc6.mp4?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>ESCAPE from blood-pumping dangers\u2026<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5b41970a963ff4fa60a43873e207bd65.poster.avif?t=1726673671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5b41970a963ff4fa60a43873e207bd65.webm?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5b41970a963ff4fa60a43873e207bd65.mp4?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>TRAVERSE the mystical realms of EXIL.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5747c4e453448b12c64afa99e5ba4880.avif?t=1726673671\" data-has-big /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/d790078bff47739098d6c142d34fbf8b.poster.avif?t=1726673671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/d790078bff47739098d6c142d34fbf8b.webm?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/d790078bff47739098d6c142d34fbf8b.mp4?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Summoned to a mystical world formed from the collision of countless realms, you find yourself at the center of a cosmic dilemma. The Primordial One, a dragon who claims to be the creator of everything, was sealed away by his own creations millennia ago. Now, his voice echoes through the dungeons, urging you to defeat his creations to break the ancient seal, offering you a return to your own world and a significant reward. Explore deep dungeons and peel back the layers of this multi-realm universe to decide whether to liberate him or carve a different destiny.",
    "about_the_game": "FIGHT against legendary beings!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/7657eaab2696e08441ebf3fab3109fc6.poster.avif?t=1726673671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/7657eaab2696e08441ebf3fab3109fc6.webm?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/7657eaab2696e08441ebf3fab3109fc6.mp4?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>ESCAPE from blood-pumping dangers\u2026<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5b41970a963ff4fa60a43873e207bd65.poster.avif?t=1726673671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5b41970a963ff4fa60a43873e207bd65.webm?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5b41970a963ff4fa60a43873e207bd65.mp4?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>TRAVERSE the mystical realms of EXIL.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/5747c4e453448b12c64afa99e5ba4880.avif?t=1726673671\" data-has-big /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/d790078bff47739098d6c142d34fbf8b.poster.avif?t=1726673671\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/d790078bff47739098d6c142d34fbf8b.webm?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2170390/extras/d790078bff47739098d6c142d34fbf8b.mp4?t=1726673671\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Summoned to a mystical world formed from the collision of countless realms, you find yourself at the center of a cosmic dilemma. The Primordial One, a dragon who claims to be the creator of everything, was sealed away by his own creations millennia ago. Now, his voice echoes through the dungeons, urging you to defeat his creations to break the ancient seal, offering you a return to your own world and a significant reward. Explore deep dungeons and peel back the layers of this multi-realm universe to decide whether to liberate him or carve a different destiny.",
